  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bishops Conference Uganda Visit</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The visit was intended to leverage on the role and influence of the Bishops Conference in other to strengthen CAFOD&#x2019;s work with partners as these Bishops oversee the Church Development Agencies. CAFOD&#x2019;s plan approach in implementing new country strategy is to work with diocesan Caritas to implement project activities and the National Caritas to provide coordination and supervision, whilst is it hoped that the Bishop Conference use information generated to champion national level engagement and advocacy at national levelivities and builds on previous experience.</narrative>
  </description>
